# A runtime directory for hand runs: point -nn-runtime or FFRWD_NN_RUNTIME
# here and the sidecar loads what is in it. Nothing fills it on its own -
# `ffrwd setup nn`, and a query that reaches a model, provision under
# ~/.cache/ffrwd/nn-runtime/<ort-version>/<platform>/ instead. The libraries
# run to hundreds of megabytes and are not needed to build, so none of them
# reach git; this file is what keeps the directory itself here.
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib
archives/
directml/
